### 1) Listar alunos
GET http://localhost:3000/alunos

### 2) Cadastrar aluno (201)
POST http://localhost:3000/alunos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Pedro",
  "email": "pedro@gmail.com"
}

### 3) Atualizar aluno 1 (200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/alunos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos Silva",
  "email": "carlossilva@gmail.com"
}

### 4) Excluir aluno 2 (200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/alunos/2

### 5) Conferir alterações
GET http://localhost:3000/alunos

### 6) Cadastro com campos vazios (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/alunos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "",
  "email": ""
}
